1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,328
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,328 --> 00:00:10,677
Protein digesting enzymes are made in an inactive form, pepsinogen and trypsinogen, so they cannot digest the gland that makes them.

3
00:00:10,677 --> 00:00:15,833
Acid activates pepsinogen; enterokinase activates trypsinogen.

4
00:00:15,833 --> 00:00:18,359
And bile contains no enzyme at all.

